      "source": "<code>HttpMessageReader</code> that wraps and delegates to a <a href=\"../../core/codec/ResourceDecoder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.codec\"><code>ResourceDecoder</code></a>\nthat extracts the filename from the <code>\"Content-Disposition\"</code> header, if\navailable, and passes it as the <a href=\"../../core/codec/ResourceDecoder.html#FILENAME_HINT\"><code>ResourceDecoder.FILENAME_HINT</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>HttpMessageReader</code> 封装并委托给一个<a href=\"../../core/codec/ResourceDecoder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.codec\"><code>ResourceDecoder</code></a>，该解码器如果可用，则从<code>\"Content-Disposition\"</code>标头中提取文件名，并将其作为<a href=\"../../core/codec/ResourceDecoder.html#FILENAME_HINT\"><code>ResourceDecoder.FILENAME_HINT</code></a>传递。",
      "count": 1
